' Models - the ships' wireframes (View.Model's form) and a sine table, as data.
' Made by art_solar.py: points are x, y, z in 4s of world units (z forward), then point pairs.
Option Explicit

Public Const M_DART = 0
Public Const M_HORNET = 45
Public Const M_MANTIS = 109
Public Const M_ROCK = 166
Public Const M_KESTREL = 228

' Base(): the address of the models (a model is Base() + M_NAME)
